WEBVTT

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.700
Do you all agree with him?

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:25.650
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.810
Which of you really wants to take the place of the current crown prince?

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:23.290
I will not allow myself to be a hostage in Shinzhu

00:00:23.530 --> 00:00:25.100
Choose: marriage or son?

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:35.750
Translators: Nemie, Kaia

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:31.130
I don't know if you will be a shield for him
or a sword with which you will get rid of him

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.290
The Crown Prince will be killed during the ritual

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:35.310
We need to finish him off during the ritual.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.780
We haven’t seen each other for two years, and you’re already sending me away?

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:45.850
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:41.040
Protect the Emperor!

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.390
Mu!

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:45.570
Where is the crown prince?

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:55.950
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.660
I don't care what she says

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:50.510
Let her go

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.130
I don't want to

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.550
Episode 3

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:03.240
She's my wife's cousin

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:07.970
She had nothing to do with this, so let her go

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:10.540
Because of her I lost a killer

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:16.790
Then you will shed innocent blood for no reason?

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:22.190
I... I'm just lost

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:24.810
Please believe me

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.050
Why would that be?

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:28.150
I don't know you

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.500
Co

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:48.890
Palace guards are everywhere. They'll catch another killer

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:52.090
And then you'll be convinced that she didn't do anything wrong.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:55.170
Until then, please

00:01:56.430 --> 00:01:57.840
let her go

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:14.630
Are you okay?

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:23.510
There... There are a lot of people there

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:26.580
They're all dead

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:28.960
Dead?

00:02:33.360 --> 00:02:36.160
They are all wearing masks

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:53.780
I shouldn't have let the 4th prince pretend to be me

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:56.700
He decided to do it himself

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.860
You don't have to feel guilty, Crown Prince.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.380
Don't say such things

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.490
I put my brother's life in danger. Is this normal?

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:07.770
He got injured

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.190
- Search the area
- Yes!

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:30.710
What did you see?

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:33.060
Did the dead get up and leave on their own?

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.560
It was definitely here

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:39.100
I know I'm right. They were all slaughtered

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.490
It was right here

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:46.970
-Where did they go?
- Were they killed?

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.630
By whom?

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:53.210
- Tell me who it was!
- How should I know?!

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.120
There was definitely a group of killers here

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:00.430
Their leader killed his people

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.130
Wasn't it the palace guards?

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.120
Have you been told anything yet?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.430
They planned everything well, since they managed to take the bodies

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.950
That man was our last witness

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.950
He died without saying a word. What are you planning to do?

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:25.270
Anyway

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.260
I won't let you hurt Su

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.960
When it gets lighter, we'll look for traces

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.620
Let's take care of your wound

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.070
Now it's over. Let's go

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.540
He always says he'll kill me

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.640
Every time I see him he says he'll kill me

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:40.140
I just wanted to give him back something he lost.

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:49.970
Su

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:52.750
Everything will be fine

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:55.110
Oh

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.700
What if he really kills me?

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:01.910
He told the man to kill me. Just said that

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:04.730
He has no heart at all

00:06:04.730 --> 00:06:08.040
What did I do wrong?

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.790
Su, everything will be fine

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:28.550
That's enough, Su. Everything is fine

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.690
Stop it. Fine?

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:39.200
Stop crying, let's go home

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.520
Everything is fine

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:12.600
Where is the crown prince?

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.660
I'm here, my emperor

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:02.820
Co

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:06.540
He interfered and ruined everything

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:10.110
This night we were supposed to celebrate your appointment as crown prince.

00:08:10.110 --> 00:08:13.160
We skillfully cleaned up after ourselves

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:18.270
There are no killers left alive

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:24.570
The Emperor will not be able to hand over the throne any time soon

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:26.730
Let's at least be happy about this

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.830
I'm surprised Seo is staying at the Crown Prince's palace

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:49.210
Choi Chi Mon's actions are also difficult to predict

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:53.180
Most likely, there is a connection between them that no one suspects.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.760
Jeong said the same thing

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.670
Surely So studied martial arts

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:03.060
The Kans wouldn't teach him

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:07.990
I need to know who he was dating and what cards he had up his sleeve.

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:12.280
Maybe if Choi Chi Mon is related to...

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:16.240
Maybe he was establishing a connection between the prince and the emperor?

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:22.230
But he said that no one had ever visited him in Shinzhu

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.390
Keep an eye on him

00:09:27.390 --> 00:09:31.450
We need to know what he's thinking about in order to get us out of the way or to win him over to our side.

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.470
Don't forget

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:40.840
Koryo should belong to my son

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:16.530
This job is not for you

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:19.090
But not what a simple servant can do

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:54.040
How long do you plan to stay in Shinzhu, brother?

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:57.050
It would be nice if you lived in Songak with the others

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.570
and attended various classes

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.110
I'm not like Uk

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:03.550
I prefer to hunt animals in the mountains

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:07.700
You are so skilled at hiding your thoughts

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:39.940
That's enough

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.190
Feel comfortable and remember to get the treatment you need

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:45.370
I will notify the servants

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:52.770
Yong Hwa

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:03.840
Sometimes I wondered what you'd grow up to be

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.930
What if you were seriously injured?

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.100
For what?

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.240
Why did you go into that forest?

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:34.640
Well, the thing is...

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.650
I'm lost

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:43.270
There were people who tried to kill the crown prince

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:46.420
- What a relief that she's alive
- That's what I'm talking about!

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:49.710
I feel incredibly lucky today

00:12:49.710 --> 00:12:54.090
It's a miracle I got off so easily

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:56.290
Are you serious?

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:01.500
- Go rest
- Okay

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.120
I'm not finished yet

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.830
Thanks for saving Su

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:21.800
Sorry that Su is a burden to you, Your Highness

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.180
Burdensome?

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.800
I never thought about her like that

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:32.220
She is the source of joy

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.030
Does she make you happy?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.290
We have a very large farm, don’t we?

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:53.320
When people come to me they always talk about difficulties

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.740
They want so much from me

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:02.250
But Su is not like that

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.880
She says she can handle everything on her own

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:11.180
I'm happy to hear this

00:14:11.180 --> 00:14:12.900
She's like a breath of fresh air

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.880
I always look forward to my next meeting with her.

00:14:27.330 --> 00:14:32.320
I am very grateful that you care so much about her, prince

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:55.930
Stop!

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:07.530
What?

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:11.580
What again?

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:29.110
I really told you everything I knew

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.510
I was very busy running away. That's why I didn't see anything else

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:36.970
Men with swords killed masked men

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:40.030
It was very sudden

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:44.940
Because... It's like everything was planned in advance

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:48.400
Think again. You must remember everything

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:49.650
Come on!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.800
That's enough

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.620
Fur

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:12.670
Everyone was wearing black clothes

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:16.220
But one man was wearing furs

00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:18.150
He told others to kill everyone

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:29.210
Have you seen his face? What did he look like?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.910
I didn't see his face

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:33.720
He was definitely their leader

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:35.960
Everything looked exactly like this

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:46.760
Who else knows about this?

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:52.270
Nobody but you bothers me with this

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:54.150
Forget everything you saw in the forest

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:57.210
Forget that man

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.090
Yes, Hae Soo. He's right

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:04.350
You'll only be safe if no one knows what you saw.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:08.670
Can I go now?

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:13.970
You

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:18.450
Don't come into my sight again

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:29.070
What did I do wrong?

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.350
You told him to kill me

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.930
They even said that you would kill me yourself

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:37.870
Should I have done nothing?

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:41.650
I did everything to survive. Or should I just die?

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:44.860
Su

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:57.450
Is it a crime to want to live?

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.630
Everybody wants to live

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.470
So why are you taking it out on me?

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:20.350
You terrible idiot!

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:31.390
I think it's best to sleep with candles lit tonight

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:35.040
You've been through terrible things, they will help drive away bad thoughts

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:41.430
Are you okay, prince?

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:44.530
I?

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:46.400
Yes you are

00:18:47.490 --> 00:18:49.300
Because of me

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.480
you killed a man

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:56.740
I'm worried that you might be having bad dreams

00:18:56.740 --> 00:19:00.360
You might be stressed or something like that

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:06.290
I can't have nightmares every time something like this happens.

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:09.390
It would be too hard

00:19:10.010 --> 00:19:12.250
So does this happen often?

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:13.760
Then you killed...

00:19:22.670 --> 00:19:23.990
I was 11

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.980
when I first took a life

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:30.720
I was 11

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:36.150
The thief got into the chambers where my mother and sister were

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:39.740
Just like today

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:42.650
I used my dagger

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:55.660
However, I didn't have nightmares

00:19:58.320 --> 00:20:00.520
I protected my family. Himself

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:05.000
I was glad

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:09.880
I was proud

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:21.290
If the prince can't even do that, what good is he?

00:20:21.290 --> 00:20:23.620
Do you still remember this

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:29.380
You can't forget. How hard is it to live with this?

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:34.240
It turns out you just live with these memories

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:41.100
It's a burden I was born with. I have to carry it

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:46.410
I won't dwell on it, so don't worry

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:48.450
What?

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:54.220
I won't burden you. So live to your heart's content

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:57.760
You don't have to worry about me

00:20:57.760 --> 00:21:00.830
I can handle everything myself

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.440
You've lost your memory

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:09.390
And now instead of it there was a feeling of courage

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.490
By the way

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:20.570
What kind of stress is this?

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:56.850
25th year of Taejo (942)

00:21:53.080 --> 00:21:57.990
The Crown Prince was attacked in the palace, right before my eyes.

00:21:57.990 --> 00:22:02.250
This attack was aimed at me and proves that we are dealing with a strong enemy

00:22:02.800 --> 00:22:06.450
Taejo Wang Gon

00:22:04.110 --> 00:22:07.080
Chi Mon, what about the traces of the killers?

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:11.770
The princes pursued them, but found no one alive

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:13.810
We explore bodies

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:15.950
We will check everything carefully

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:20.080
Emperor, the killers were acrobats from Songak

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:21.930
I will find those who let them into the palace

00:22:22.470 --> 00:22:23.920
Yes, find it

00:22:28.210 --> 00:22:30.310
How's your wound?

00:22:36.550 --> 00:22:38.150
She was shallow

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:40.310
I received treatment at the 8th Prince's Palace

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:44.350
Why did you switch roles with the Crown Prince?

00:22:44.350 --> 00:22:46.890
Your life was in danger

00:22:48.250 --> 00:22:51.410
Crown Prince Mu saved my life 15 years ago

00:22:51.410 --> 00:22:57.120
So I want to stay in Songak and find out who is behind all this

00:23:00.300 --> 00:23:01.530
Are you?

00:23:01.530 --> 00:23:04.990
If you allow it, Your Majesty, I will find out who is behind this.

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:10.010
Okay

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:12.620
Chi Mon

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:17.020
Report to Shinju that Seo needs to do something for me.

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:19.130
He'll be back later than he should have been

00:23:19.130 --> 00:23:20.770
I'm sure they won't mind

00:23:44.920 --> 00:23:47.030
You know our 4th brother

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:49.260
Do you really think he was into martial arts?

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:53.550
During the ritual he was like...

00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:56.070
It's because he dealt with wild animals

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:58.010
Don't encourage his pride

00:23:58.510 --> 00:24:02.280
But this was not the level of a person who trained on his own

00:24:02.280 --> 00:24:06.320
I'm sure he was seriously involved with someone

00:24:06.320 --> 00:24:11.120
Did the Kang family teach their hostage martial arts?

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:13.190
Why do they need this?

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:17.950
If any of you hear anything, tell me

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:19.430
It's funny to listen

00:24:19.430 --> 00:24:22.620
Do you want us to find out about the 4th brother's skills?

00:24:23.310 --> 00:24:27.280
Baek Ah, you have a lot of friends. It will be easy for you to find out everything

00:24:27.280 --> 00:24:30.430
The people who visit my house are musicians and women

00:24:30.430 --> 00:24:32.070
So it won't be easy

00:24:36.110 --> 00:24:40.130
Didn't you chase the killers last night?

00:24:41.970 --> 00:24:43.260
Stalked

00:24:44.790 --> 00:24:48.110
But I went the wrong way, so I didn't find anyone

00:24:48.110 --> 00:24:50.020
I didn't even encounter a rat on the way.

00:24:52.230 --> 00:24:54.410
I thought you were in the same forest

00:24:54.410 --> 00:24:57.470
I was so hoping you'd catch at least one of them

00:25:00.080 --> 00:25:01.710
I'm sorry too

00:25:02.920 --> 00:25:06.690
If I had been there, would they have run away so easily?

00:25:15.330 --> 00:25:17.440
Your Majesty!

00:25:17.440 --> 00:25:20.760
Celebrating New Year? Enjoy each other's company

00:25:22.610 --> 00:25:25.320
Y'all tried your best last night

00:25:25.320 --> 00:25:29.490
If any of you are injured, do not delay visiting a doctor.

00:25:29.940 --> 00:25:33.010
That's what we'll do, don't worry

00:25:37.350 --> 00:25:39.790
Eun, why do you have a bruise on your face?

00:25:39.790 --> 00:25:40.900
What?

00:25:41.220 --> 00:25:43.540
Ah... yes this is...

00:25:44.470 --> 00:25:46.700
I got into a fight

00:25:46.700 --> 00:25:48.360
Into a fight?

00:25:48.360 --> 00:25:51.480
A fight in which the prince's face was injured?

00:25:51.980 --> 00:25:54.990
Why has the dignity of our family fallen so low?

00:25:57.100 --> 00:26:00.520
Who did it? Tell me right away

00:26:01.250 --> 00:26:02.960
Oh, this...

00:26:04.670 --> 00:26:05.780
This...

00:26:07.360 --> 00:26:11.360
Will the 10th prince come with punishment from the emperor?

00:26:11.360 --> 00:26:14.680
Yes. Usually it is carried out by the authorities...

00:26:14.680 --> 00:26:17.080
The 10th Prince insisted on coming himself

00:26:17.080 --> 00:26:20.410
Just wants to see what will happen to me

00:26:22.400 --> 00:26:25.040
They're not going to cut off my legs or arms, are they?

00:26:25.040 --> 00:26:26.460
I don't know...

00:26:26.460 --> 00:26:29.760
The 8th Prince is probably aware of this?

00:26:29.760 --> 00:26:31.590
There must be

00:26:33.070 --> 00:26:35.960
Nothing will happen. Yes...

00:26:37.380 --> 00:26:38.920
Will I remain intact?

00:26:44.110 --> 00:26:46.120
Prince Eun! Prince Eun!

00:26:47.510 --> 00:26:50.930
Your Highness! Your Highness! Wait!

00:26:56.810 --> 00:27:00.010
Oh, darling, aren't you waiting for me?

00:27:02.790 --> 00:27:06.560
What kind of punishment does the emperor have in store for me?

00:27:06.560 --> 00:27:10.930
The Emperor was furious when he saw the bruise on my face.

00:27:10.930 --> 00:27:12.890
Told me to beat you up

00:27:14.030 --> 00:27:15.840
Why beat me?

00:27:15.840 --> 00:27:18.070
It was your own fault!

00:27:18.070 --> 00:27:22.030
He didn’t talk about the fact that he asked for the fists, right?

00:27:22.030 --> 00:27:25.150
Do you think I'm so petty?

00:27:25.150 --> 00:27:27.170
I asked the emperor to have mercy on you,

00:27:27.170 --> 00:27:28.540
you can't even imagine

00:27:29.770 --> 00:27:32.570
If the girl who hit the prince should be punished,

00:27:32.570 --> 00:27:35.970
What punishment will the guy who couldn't defend himself get?

00:27:35.970 --> 00:27:39.980
This wise quote should be written down in history

00:27:39.980 --> 00:27:42.330
What do you think? Thankful to me, right?

00:27:42.330 --> 00:27:46.880
Well I don't know why you're so good to me

00:27:46.880 --> 00:27:49.910
Yes, I'm deathly grateful

00:27:49.910 --> 00:27:52.670
- Hey!
- What else?

00:27:52.670 --> 00:27:55.920
I...have to tell you something

00:27:58.140 --> 00:28:01.200
Well... I...

00:28:02.800 --> 00:28:04.950
You can go. Faster

00:28:07.120 --> 00:28:09.810
And you go too. Fast!

00:28:12.170 --> 00:28:14.190
What is expected?

00:28:14.190 --> 00:28:15.620
Nothing like that

00:28:15.620 --> 00:28:18.010
I'm not one to hold grudges

00:28:18.010 --> 00:28:19.390
Then what?

00:28:20.120 --> 00:28:21.160
Just...

00:28:22.240 --> 00:28:23.830
Well...

00:28:26.060 --> 00:28:27.610
I'm saying...

00:28:35.310 --> 00:28:37.450
Is he really

00:28:39.750 --> 00:28:41.630
fell in love with me?

00:28:42.170 --> 00:28:44.390
"You were the first girl to treat me like that."

00:28:44.390 --> 00:28:45.450
Right?

00:28:47.500 --> 00:28:49.070
I wanted to say here

00:28:49.070 --> 00:28:53.100
you were the first girl to treat me like that

00:28:53.100 --> 00:28:54.510
What the hell is this?

00:28:55.270 --> 00:28:56.400
What?

00:28:56.780 --> 00:29:01.020
I just didn't know that this expression has been used for thousands of years

00:29:01.020 --> 00:29:02.780
Great expression

00:29:02.780 --> 00:29:04.100
A thousand years?

00:29:04.100 --> 00:29:08.640
In general, this is the first time I have fought so openly since I grew up.

00:29:08.640 --> 00:29:11.170
Everyone: both mother and grandfather

00:29:11.170 --> 00:29:13.080
I was afraid I would get hurt

00:29:13.080 --> 00:29:15.270
I've never fought anyone before

00:29:15.270 --> 00:29:16.960
It was fun, a lot

00:29:16.960 --> 00:29:19.770
Yes, then you are welcome

00:29:19.770 --> 00:29:21.880
I will beat you without holding back

00:29:21.880 --> 00:29:24.940
Do you want me to come to you often?

00:29:24.940 --> 00:29:28.470
And what? Thanks to you I wasn't punished

00:29:28.470 --> 00:29:30.130
It's the least I can do

00:29:33.020 --> 00:29:36.530
Today is our first day!

00:30:09.550 --> 00:30:11.520
- There's a fight there!
- Where?

00:30:11.520 --> 00:30:13.110
Quicker!

00:30:13.110 --> 00:30:14.110
Here! Here!

00:30:14.110 --> 00:30:15.760
There's some kind of fight there!

00:31:02.400 --> 00:31:04.240
So, next!

00:31:16.980 --> 00:31:19.350
Brother! Brother!

00:31:32.160 --> 00:31:34.330
Brother! Brother! Brother!

00:31:34.330 --> 00:31:36.120
Give it to me at least once!

00:31:36.120 --> 00:31:38.120
Don't even try

00:31:41.990 --> 00:31:44.890
Then sell me this drawing

00:31:46.610 --> 00:31:48.450
And you give me a house

00:31:49.440 --> 00:31:52.340
Then I won't let you leave with him!

00:31:52.340 --> 00:31:54.700
You are also dressed in ordinary clothes, out to have fun!

00:31:54.700 --> 00:31:56.000
I? Having fun?

00:31:56.020 --> 00:31:59.440
The Emperor ordered me to record people's lives

00:31:59.440 --> 00:32:01.910
You don't know anything, go away

00:32:02.510 --> 00:32:04.100
Brother!

00:32:04.100 --> 00:32:06.180
Don't follow me! I have important things to do

00:32:06.180 --> 00:32:07.950
You just go to Uku’s house!

00:32:13.840 --> 00:32:15.180
Hey

00:32:16.060 --> 00:32:17.230
Hey!

00:32:19.990 --> 00:32:22.490
- Thank you, brother!
- Well, stay there!

00:33:02.040 --> 00:33:05.560
I remember well how we spent time together as children

00:33:06.480 --> 00:33:08.380
Those days were like a dream

00:33:09.450 --> 00:33:11.810
I'm offended by Uka

00:33:13.100 --> 00:33:17.850
13th Prince Baek Ah

00:33:14.450 --> 00:33:18.320
If only he could open his heart to you more, sister.

00:33:19.740 --> 00:33:21.790
I asked you not to call me that

00:33:21.790 --> 00:33:23.460
Your brother might hear

00:33:23.460 --> 00:33:27.010
Before you were my daughter-in-law, you were my sister!

00:33:27.010 --> 00:33:30.790
I recognized you before Uka, he can't do anything about it

00:33:31.520 --> 00:33:34.420
He treats you well, pretending he doesn't hear anything

00:33:34.420 --> 00:33:35.960
Be careful

00:33:35.960 --> 00:33:38.120
I don't want

00:33:38.120 --> 00:33:40.260
Once a sister, always a sister

00:33:47.660 --> 00:33:49.280
Okay

00:33:49.280 --> 00:33:51.230
Okay, okay

00:33:51.270 --> 00:33:53.960
Isn't that Hae Soo there?

00:33:54.750 --> 00:33:56.300
Okay

00:33:57.310 --> 00:34:00.310
Okay. Fine!

00:34:00.310 --> 00:34:01.960
Okay

00:34:03.690 --> 00:34:05.930
"This will end badly for you!"

00:34:05.930 --> 00:34:08.450
"You solved your own crime!"

00:34:12.060 --> 00:34:15.470
“You don’t need to look at what a married couple is doing.”

00:34:15.470 --> 00:34:18.650
"I'll take care of you"

00:34:18.650 --> 00:34:20.970
"Do you understand?"

00:34:20.970 --> 00:34:23.510
I didn't understand!

00:34:23.510 --> 00:34:25.540
I heard she hurt her head

00:34:25.540 --> 00:34:28.360
Looks like she's starting to look different from her old self.

00:34:28.360 --> 00:34:30.660
Even that fight with the 10th prince

00:34:30.690 --> 00:34:32.620
She's been very interesting lately

00:34:32.620 --> 00:34:36.950
Her memory did not return, but she became more affectionate

00:34:36.950 --> 00:34:39.140
- She surprises me
- Okay

00:34:39.140 --> 00:34:41.230
Okay

00:34:41.230 --> 00:34:43.450
She became very awkward as an assistant

00:34:45.950 --> 00:34:47.550
This girl

00:34:48.480 --> 00:34:51.460
very similar to you

00:34:53.120 --> 00:34:55.830
Why are you saying this?

00:34:57.100 --> 00:34:59.130
Nothing is holding her back

00:34:59.130 --> 00:35:01.500
She says things that others won't think about.

00:35:01.500 --> 00:35:03.030
Very free

00:35:03.720 --> 00:35:05.750
Likes funny things

00:35:05.750 --> 00:35:07.910
Hates losing, gets angry because of it

00:35:07.910 --> 00:35:10.040
I would believe that she is your sister

00:35:11.020 --> 00:35:14.360
Baek Ah, I'm not your sister, it's Soo

00:35:16.060 --> 00:35:17.950
Don't say that

00:35:17.950 --> 00:35:20.650
You know well about my feelings...

00:35:25.450 --> 00:35:26.650
to you

00:35:35.550 --> 00:35:36.940
Sister!

00:36:36.900 --> 00:36:38.990
What does "no languages" mean?

00:36:38.990 --> 00:36:41.580
What did they promise and who did it?

00:36:41.580 --> 00:36:44.210
did he even cut out their tongues?

00:36:44.210 --> 00:36:47.210
Could this be a professional group of killers?

00:36:47.210 --> 00:36:50.440
Like "Komge"? Or "Chilsal"?

00:36:50.440 --> 00:36:52.520
It can't be Hoksalvol...

00:36:54.070 --> 00:36:56.350
I'm the only one thinking here!

00:36:56.350 --> 00:36:59.230
You too must gather your thoughts!

00:36:59.880 --> 00:37:01.590
This is Daegyuwan's Hell

00:37:01.590 --> 00:37:05.510
Those who committed murder or adultery had their tongues cut out

00:37:06.560 --> 00:37:08.270
Here's a failure

00:37:12.250 --> 00:37:14.230
They no longer had languages

00:37:15.220 --> 00:37:16.260
What?

00:37:16.770 --> 00:37:19.520
What if their tongues weren’t cut out, but they simply weren’t there in the first place?

00:37:19.520 --> 00:37:22.740
I heard this type of punishment is applied to fallen monks

00:37:22.740 --> 00:37:24.030
Carry on

00:37:24.030 --> 00:37:27.920
After punishment, such monks are excluded from the sacred order

00:37:27.920 --> 00:37:31.200
He could use such men without tongues as killers

00:37:31.200 --> 00:37:34.950
Killers who were disguised as participants in the ritual

00:37:39.840 --> 00:37:44.170
Then... who is behind this?

00:37:45.420 --> 00:37:47.650
The one who has more than anyone else

00:37:48.260 --> 00:37:51.780
The one who was able to meet the fallen monks unnoticed

00:37:53.380 --> 00:37:57.350
Chi Mon, find out who's been going into town these days.

00:37:57.350 --> 00:37:58.730
I obey, Crown Prince

00:38:04.830 --> 00:38:06.310
What are you doing?

00:38:06.310 --> 00:38:07.730
Is that you?

00:38:07.730 --> 00:38:09.850
You wanted to kill the crown prince

00:38:09.850 --> 00:38:12.210
Sick idiot, don't try to blame me

00:38:12.210 --> 00:38:13.840
Is there any evidence?

00:38:15.650 --> 00:38:19.290
Used monks as assassins and then killed them all

00:38:19.290 --> 00:38:21.750
- Isn't that right?
- What kind of nonsense?

00:38:21.750 --> 00:38:23.150
Let me go

00:38:26.910 --> 00:38:28.340
Did your mother tell you?

00:38:33.060 --> 00:38:34.270
What?

00:38:35.910 --> 00:38:38.170
I ask, is this her doing?!

00:38:41.870 --> 00:38:44.300
Don't you dare disgrace your mother!

00:39:06.130 --> 00:39:08.390
Jeong, you hurt yourself

00:39:32.570 --> 00:39:33.620
And this

00:39:34.220 --> 00:39:36.120
Also old

00:39:39.050 --> 00:39:41.590
Sister, what's going on?

00:39:43.760 --> 00:39:46.180
The prince donates food and things

00:39:46.180 --> 00:39:48.270
for those affected by frost

00:39:48.270 --> 00:39:50.330
Here's how

00:39:51.000 --> 00:39:52.410
Won't you go?

00:39:53.760 --> 00:39:56.530
I? I don't know

00:39:57.050 --> 00:39:59.190
The prince usually walks alone

00:39:59.190 --> 00:40:01.600
How? You should go with him

00:40:01.600 --> 00:40:04.360
You can help him, at the same time you can take a walk

00:40:04.360 --> 00:40:05.520
It'll be great

00:40:09.800 --> 00:40:11.460
I'll paint you

00:40:15.100 --> 00:40:16.780
Is this good?

00:40:18.500 --> 00:40:21.870
This is for eyebrows

00:40:22.380 --> 00:40:23.880
Powder?

00:40:35.850 --> 00:40:37.750
I had a dream

00:40:39.670 --> 00:40:42.600
In it I painted people for money

00:40:44.950 --> 00:40:48.390
There were a lot of people, friends came too

00:40:49.030 --> 00:40:51.210
It wasn't boring

00:40:52.790 --> 00:40:54.150
How to say?

00:40:54.960 --> 00:40:58.560
I felt important

00:40:59.950 --> 00:41:04.000
I liked the feeling that I made people special

00:41:04.710 --> 00:41:06.980
I felt like someone needed me

00:41:08.900 --> 00:41:14.600
Stupid me, I thought I could make someone happy

00:41:16.540 --> 00:41:18.090
Feel the aroma

00:41:18.090 --> 00:41:19.660
Smells like a rose, doesn't it?

00:41:19.660 --> 00:41:23.400
This is a good option for those who have problems choosing colors

00:41:25.450 --> 00:41:26.640
Hey!

00:41:28.380 --> 00:41:29.630
I'm here!

00:41:39.360 --> 00:41:43.460
But I helped my friend become beautiful,

00:41:43.460 --> 00:41:45.750
and she started dating my boyfriend

00:41:48.130 --> 00:41:50.750
She betrayed me

00:41:52.160 --> 00:41:54.350
Both lied to me

00:41:54.350 --> 00:41:57.770
They took everything I had, including my house.

00:42:00.070 --> 00:42:05.120
But I was stupid, I couldn’t even tell them anything

00:42:06.700 --> 00:42:08.430
So it was a nightmare

00:42:09.400 --> 00:42:11.860
Bad dreams should be quickly forgotten

00:42:12.580 --> 00:42:14.020
Nightmare?

00:42:17.950 --> 00:42:19.460
You're right

00:42:20.190 --> 00:42:24.860
Maybe it was all a bad dream

00:42:26.210 --> 00:42:27.250
That's it!

00:42:28.900 --> 00:42:32.750
I'm not used to the colors here yet, so I'm a little clumsy

00:42:33.320 --> 00:42:35.850
So how? You're beautiful, right?

00:42:40.810 --> 00:42:42.080
How...

00:42:45.810 --> 00:42:47.600
How did you change your complexion?

00:42:50.070 --> 00:42:52.090
Do you have a talent for this?

00:43:05.210 --> 00:43:06.890
Thank you!

00:43:33.480 --> 00:43:34.900
Kids, come here

00:43:38.590 --> 00:43:41.250
Share with each other

00:43:42.580 --> 00:43:44.280
Thank you

00:43:45.150 --> 00:43:46.380
Hey!

00:43:50.210 --> 00:43:51.420
Come here!

00:43:51.420 --> 00:43:53.400
Come here, come here, come here!

00:43:53.400 --> 00:43:54.560
Come here

00:43:55.280 --> 00:43:57.290
Is sharing with friends good or bad?

00:43:57.290 --> 00:43:59.130
Are you still going to behave like this or not?

00:43:59.130 --> 00:44:00.630
You won't, will you?

00:44:01.160 --> 00:44:03.400
Come on, let's go

00:44:10.780 --> 00:44:12.820
Yeah, prepare it for me

00:44:12.820 --> 00:44:13.920
Yes

00:44:29.720 --> 00:44:32.290
Didn't know you had an interest in drugs

00:44:33.090 --> 00:44:34.600
When I got here...

00:44:34.600 --> 00:44:40.020
I mean... after the injury, I'm glad to see what I remember

00:44:40.640 --> 00:44:45.370
Silkworms, mung beans, buttercups and galangal root

00:44:46.620 --> 00:44:49.310
When did you learn all this?

00:44:49.310 --> 00:44:51.260
Even I don't know all this

00:44:51.260 --> 00:44:53.170
I used to make soap

00:44:54.710 --> 00:44:55.730
Soap?

00:44:56.250 --> 00:44:59.980
And... this... is for swimming...

00:45:00.530 --> 00:45:02.260
Bathing assistant!

00:45:04.220 --> 00:45:07.080
All these ingredients are used for skin care

00:45:07.080 --> 00:45:11.540
If you use them when washing your face, your skin will be very good.

00:45:11.540 --> 00:45:14.410
Need to do it for my sister!

00:45:18.820 --> 00:45:21.050
This is medicine for your wife

00:45:21.050 --> 00:45:23.710
And this is a cure for wounds, as you asked.

00:45:23.710 --> 00:45:26.030
- Oh, thank you
- Yes

00:45:31.460 --> 00:45:33.490
- Su
- Yes?

00:45:35.200 --> 00:45:36.500
Take it

00:45:42.020 --> 00:45:44.250
A girl shouldn't have scars on her body.

00:45:47.580 --> 00:45:48.960
Thank you

00:46:32.260 --> 00:46:34.080
I'm just worried that the scar will remain.

00:46:34.730 --> 00:46:37.010
I can call the doctor if you're shy about me

00:47:49.550 --> 00:47:51.800
Madam, the prince is coming

00:49:28.350 --> 00:49:34.450
But loving you is very painful for me

00:49:34.450 --> 00:49:36.650
And so sad

00:49:36.650 --> 00:49:41.150
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:49:39.790 --> 00:49:41.220
Mom

00:49:42.450 --> 00:49:44.050
so hard

00:49:42.730 --> 00:49:45.600
You're probably crying bitterly because of me

00:49:46.250 --> 00:49:50.350
Don't forget, please!

00:49:47.140 --> 00:49:50.710
No need. Everything is fine

00:49:51.220 --> 00:49:55.650
That eternal love of mine

00:49:56.610 --> 00:49:58.090
Honestly speaking,

00:49:58.100 --> 00:50:03.550
And it’s still just as difficult for me to forget you

00:50:01.700 --> 00:50:05.860
my heart... is trembling

00:50:04.150 --> 00:50:06.310
It's so hard for me

00:50:06.310 --> 00:50:12.850
This dream is bad, when I remember, I cry

00:50:08.190 --> 00:50:10.480
I convince myself that it shouldn’t be like this...

00:50:12.850 --> 00:50:13.940
always

00:50:16.160 --> 00:50:19.650
I believe once upon a time

00:50:16.570 --> 00:50:18.040
But it doesn't help

00:50:20.850 --> 00:50:24.450
how I want to love

00:50:26.200 --> 00:50:27.650
I can

00:51:11.750 --> 00:51:14.030
I found the killers' hideout

00:53:13.380 --> 00:53:15.180
Who is the leader here?

00:53:15.910 --> 00:53:17.010
Come out

00:53:21.090 --> 00:53:24.970
Neither of you can say a word?

00:53:45.570 --> 00:53:48.310
Who created this disgusting place?

00:53:51.390 --> 00:53:53.670
Who?!

00:56:05.880 --> 00:56:08.130
Are you in charge here?

00:56:08.130 --> 00:56:13.600
The sins of these people burdened them, so they accepted the punishment

00:56:14.430 --> 00:56:17.890
I was ordered to watch them

00:56:18.840 --> 00:56:23.460
Then... are you saying we need to get rid of you?

00:56:23.460 --> 00:56:26.940
Who exactly are you?

00:56:28.670 --> 00:56:33.230
Does your mother, Prince, know about this?

00:56:35.880 --> 00:56:38.500
This is a place where people shouldn't talk

00:56:39.900 --> 00:56:42.210
But there's one chatterbox standing in front of me

00:57:21.200 --> 00:57:23.200
You lived for the Empress

00:57:24.240 --> 00:57:25.720
So die for her

00:58:06.950 --> 00:58:09.350
Chi Mon, is this the right place?

00:58:09.350 --> 00:58:10.860
Yes I'm sure

00:58:10.860 --> 00:58:13.350
What happened here?

00:58:13.350 --> 00:58:16.780
Stop the fire! Find survivors if there are any!

00:58:16.780 --> 00:58:18.060
- Eat!
- Eat!

00:58:25.440 --> 00:58:27.520
"Taegyuwan's Hell"

00:58:59.960 --> 00:59:01.260
Who's here?

00:59:03.090 --> 00:59:05.020
I, mother

00:59:08.630 --> 00:59:10.230
How dare you...

00:59:33.000 --> 00:59:40.650
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:33.000 --> 00:59:40.650
