http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:40.650 --> 00:59:40.750
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:41.130 --> 00:59:43.360
Never say again that I belong to you

00:59:41.550 --> 00:59:47.870
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

00:59:43.360 --> 00:59:45.940
Then should I call you "my man"?

00:59:46.240 --> 00:59:47.730
I was afraid that I had lost you

00:59:47.870 --> 00:59:53.650
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

00:59:48.350 --> 00:59:50.230
Thought I'd never see you again

00:59:50.450 --> 00:59:51.600
I was scared
